{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fleeting yet heartrending hamburger story awaits you.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Setuna&quot; sets out to visit his warrior comrade &quot;Kaede.&quot; The player becomes &quot;Kaede&quot; and experiences a legendary tale. With an overwhelmingly smooth gameplay feel, cut down enemies freely and without restraint!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring a completely professional-grade, original action mechanic\u2014the &quot;Motion Control System&quot;\u2014where every motion and every frame can be canceled. Now even more powered up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can cancel any action on a frame-by-frame basis and seamlessly chain it into the next move. It perfectly captures and expresses the precise input mastery of expert-level players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007890/extras/c751850130baf75f6b5d0479984ed09a.poster.avif?t=1773968112\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007890/extras/c751850130baf75f6b5d0479984ed09a.webm?t=1773968112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007890/extras/c751850130baf75f6b5d0479984ed09a.mp4?t=1773968112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aerial movement, inertia-based movement system, and smooth camera control give you complete domination over 3D space.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The new system, the <strong>\u201cInertia Movement System,\u201d</strong> instantly harnesses the propulsion of high-speed movement. A professional-grade movement system that overturns the conventional wisdom of traditional action games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007890/extras/21e97e5a51c6c8bdf900ffd2f02928ec.poster.avif?t=1773968112\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007890/extras/21e97e5a51c6c8bdf900ffd2f02928ec.webm?t=1773968112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007890/extras/21e97e5a51c6c8bdf900ffd2f02928ec.mp4?t=1773968112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera adjustments on par with e-sports shooting games. By eliminating unnecessary character motions, perfect rotational control is achieved. Players can take complete command of the 3D space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007890/extras/1b53a79a9e62521f8ddd3d8de016415b.poster.avif?t=1773968112\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007890/extras/1b53a79a9e62521f8ddd3d8de016415b.webm?t=1773968112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007890/extras/1b53a79a9e62521f8ddd3d8de016415b.mp4?t=1773968112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Single-player only, no corrections whatsoever, fully direct input. Perfect optimization prioritizing processing speed. High-speed performance.\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bZero development cost, single-person development team. A personal research project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bPermission is granted for anyone to freely use and distribute the game content in videos or live streams without restrictions.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chapter 1 cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4007890/c9302f90a8f66d2117006dfb582bcec148b9f97d.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 1 Hard cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4007890/88b9e950c79472d56765df8ef71095a916256369.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 2 cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4007890/554aa8adeaacbb81e453e8b9f62297d182545674.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 2 Hard cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4007890/c00cc8481f01ba340b5798ad8a2e76103f9a6403.jpg"},{"name":"Setuna Mode cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4007890/be57ad0e06387f821bfecc6dc636686af0e0fdbc.jpg"},{"name":"Burger Bomb Acquired","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4007890/68519e4ca0b08a97385126bf4a03d656d892c0f9.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4007890?t=1773968112","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007890/106193862340bc40536f26d92f91f9450d4da2fe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773968112","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007890/25781d2c770bd00be87fb70f4c07a17111d4f168/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773968112","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007890/25781d2c770bd00be87fb70f4c07a17111d4f168/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773968112","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fleeting yet heartrending hamburger story awaits you.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Setuna&quot; sets out to visit his warrior comrade &quot;Kaede.&quot; The player becomes &quot;Kaede&quot; and experiences a legendary tale. With an overwhelmingly smooth gameplay feel, cut down enemies freely and without restraint!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring a completely professional-grade, original action mechanic\u2014the &quot;Motion Control System&quot;\u2014where every motion and every frame can be canceled. Now even more powered up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can cancel any action on a frame-by-frame basis and seamlessly chain it into the next move. It perfectly captures and expresses the precise input mastery of expert-level players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007890/extras/c751850130baf75f6b5d0479984ed09a.poster.avif?t=1773968112\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007890/extras/c751850130baf75f6b5d0479984ed09a.webm?t=1773968112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007890/extras/c751850130baf75f6b5d0479984ed09a.mp4?t=1773968112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aerial movement, inertia-based movement system, and smooth camera control give you complete domination over 3D space.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The new system, the <strong>\u201cInertia Movement System,\u201d</strong> instantly harnesses the propulsion of high-speed movement. A professional-grade movement system that overturns the conventional wisdom of traditional action games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007890/extras/21e97e5a51c6c8bdf900ffd2f02928ec.poster.avif?t=1773968112\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=